	(text "Path B (diagram 08): slide SW701 to PROG, the ESP32 holds RST_N low through Q701, writes the W25Q32 with plain SPI (SPI2), reads it back, releases the\nflash lines, then RST_N.\nEach TS5A3166 adds 18-19 pF (off) to its XVF QSPI line (TI SCDS188D). IN threshold 2.0 V at 3.3 V.\nJ701: shunts on 13-14 and 15-16 join the ESP32 and XVF I2C buses (the 4.7k pull-ups here then serve both). XVF I2C has no pull-ups of its own. 1V8\npin: low current only (shared with the XVF3800). 21/22 = ESP32 UART0 TX/RX (boot log at power-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.54 140.9882 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "be7d319d-9421-5d18-9826-5710e9cb33de")
	)
